{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"诗篇","commonName":"诗篇","title":"诗篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"dbc381a0d937a76da00e224516c540ebdb97b246a5380bed1b67f15a492e5440","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":52,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神的审判和恩惠"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["以东人多益来告诉扫罗说：「大卫到了亚希米勒家。」那时，大卫作这训诲诗，交与伶长。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"勇士啊，你为何以作恶自夸？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神的慈爱是常存的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的舌头邪恶诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像剃头刀，快利伤人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你爱恶胜似爱善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又爱说谎，不爱说公义。 （细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诡诈的舌头啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你爱说一切毁灭的话！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"神也要毁灭你，直到永远；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要把你拿去，从你的帐棚中抽出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从活人之地将你拔出。 （细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"义人要看见而惧怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并要笑他，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说：看哪，这就是那不以 神为他力量的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只倚仗他丰富的财物，在邪恶上坚立自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"至于我，就像 神殿中的青橄榄树；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我永永远远倚靠 神的慈爱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要称谢你，直到永远，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你行了这事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要在你圣民面前仰望你的名；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这名本为美好。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/52.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/53.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/51.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}